<style>
  .result-panel {
    width: 560px;
    height: 250px;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #182631;
    border-color: #ef4444;
    border-width: 4px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .result-title {
    color: #fca5a5;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Keep this to ONE LINE, and do not add `text-align`.
     This span rendered NOTHING for a long time and nobody noticed, because both
     failures are silent — no truncation, no overflow, just no text:
       - `text-align: center` made it vanish outright, even for short copy.
       - Copy long enough to wrap vanishes too; the panel is a fixed 250px and
         drops the whole child rather than clipping it. A 75-character string
         disappeared; 43 characters renders.
     At 21px that is roughly 50 characters. Centring comes from the panel's
     `align-items: center` instead, which is why no width is set here — a width
     would define a wrap box, and wrapping is the thing that kills it. */
  .result-body {
    color: #edf4f7;
    font-size: 21px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .result-button {
    width: 190px;
    height: 48px;
    padding: 0px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #dbe7ed;
    border-color: #8fa3ad;
    border-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: #172731;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .result-actions {
    width: 410px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .result-icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .restart-button {
    background-color: #dcfce7;
    border-color: #4a9b68;
    color: #17452a;
  }
</style>

<Panel id="result-panel" class="result-panel">
  <span id="result-title" class="result-title">COMMAND CENTER LOST</span>
  <span id="result-body" class="result-body">All friendly forces were destroyed.</span>
  <div class="result-actions">
    <button id="result-restart" class="result-button restart-button"><RotateCcwIcon class="result-icon"></RotateCcwIcon><span>Restart</span></button>
    <button id="result-exit-vr" class="result-button"><LogOutIcon class="result-icon"></LogOutIcon><span>Exit VR</span></button>
  </div>
</Panel>
